WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.043 --> 00:00:03.422
[reporter, in English] Her case
is grabbing headlines across the nation.

00:00:03.505 --> 00:00:06.257
People want to know,
where is Vanessa Guillén?

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.508
[woman 1] Where's my sister?

00:00:07.592 --> 00:00:09.885
They know where she is.
I want them to speak up.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:14.182
This was not one of those cases
the military could sweep under the rug.

00:00:15.058 --> 00:00:17.685
[woman 1] Vanessa's always been
the bravest of all of us.

00:00:17.768 --> 00:00:21.230
Something was wrong with her the few months
after she was stationed at Fort Hood.

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:23.483
[woman 2] Not being able to sleep,
losing weight.

00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:26.027
She would tell me
that things weren't what they seemed.

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:29.863
[in Spanish] She said,
"I have been harassed by a superior."

00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:33.743
Over at Fort Hood, it's nothing more
than a place of corruption and evil.

00:00:33.827 --> 00:00:35.828
[woman 2, in English]
I called the staff sergeant.

00:00:35.912 --> 00:00:37.663
He's like, "We don't know anything
about her."

00:00:37.747 --> 00:00:40.958
"You guys don't have cameras, nothing?"
And they were like, "No."

00:00:41.042 --> 00:00:42.835
[woman 3] The military
did not give a damn.

00:00:43.837 --> 00:00:47.507
Fort Hood seems to cultivate
the worst of the worst.

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:51.093
[man] A lot of missing soldiers,
a lot of dead soldiers.

00:00:51.177 --> 00:00:52.553
A lot of bad there.

00:00:53.137 --> 00:00:55.723
[woman 4] She's in the Army.
She's supposed to be safe there.

00:00:55.807 --> 00:00:57.517
[in Spanish] I texted. No answer.
"How come?"

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.397
"These animals won't look for my child.
I have to look for my daughter myself."

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:04.690
[man in English] The Guillén family
weren't gonna stay quiet.

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:07.360
[woman 4] The Hispanic culture
is a sleeping giant,

00:01:07.443 --> 00:01:09.070
and the Guillén family woke it up.

00:01:09.153 --> 00:01:11.238
- [protester] What do we want?
- [crowd] Justice!

00:01:11.782 --> 00:01:14.783
[woman 2] People using my sister
as a resemblance of themselves.

00:01:14.867 --> 00:01:17.203
[woman 5] #IAmVanessaGuillén.

00:01:17.287 --> 00:01:19.913
I remember saying, "She is us."

00:01:19.997 --> 00:01:21.623
[woman 1] It kept growing and growing.

00:01:21.708 --> 00:01:23.585
- [protester] What do we want?
- [crowd] Justice!

00:01:23.668 --> 00:01:25.087
What's her name?

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:26.128
[crowd] Vanessa!

00:01:26.212 --> 00:01:28.047
[woman 1] Loud and proud! What do we want?

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:30.842
[woman 7] Sexual assault scandals
are the new norm for the military.

00:01:30.925 --> 00:01:32.385
Clearly an epidemic.

00:01:32.468 --> 00:01:35.638
[woman 1] We had no other choice
but to go and fight for a legislation

00:01:35.722 --> 00:01:37.182
under my sister's name.

00:01:37.265 --> 00:01:41.435
[man] The military counts on survivors
and their families staying quiet,

00:01:41.518 --> 00:01:43.855
and they miscalculated dramatically.

00:01:43.938 --> 00:01:47.733
[woman 2] If we got Congress to listen,
then we can get Congress to pass the bill.

00:01:47.817 --> 00:01:49.068
This is our last chance.

00:01:49.152 --> 00:01:51.863
They do not support
the full Vanessa Guillén Act.

00:01:51.947 --> 00:01:53.740
We have to really push on them.

00:01:53.823 --> 00:01:56.993
This is not a Republican-Democratic issue!
This is not a race issue!

00:01:57.077 --> 00:01:59.620
This is a human issue,
so it should be everyone's issue!

00:01:59.703 --> 00:02:00.622
[dramatic music swells]

